---
import SiteLayout from '../../components/SiteLayout.astro';
import { findPost } from '../../data/blog';

const post = findPost('the-story-wasnt-over')!;
---

<SiteLayout
  title={`${post.title} — Songdance`}
  description={post.excerpt}
  image={post.hero}
  imageAlt={post.heroAlt}
>
  <article class="bp">
    <header class="bp-head">
      <p class="sd-eyebrow">Journal · The story behind the journey · Part two</p>
      <h1 class="bp-title">The story wasn't <em class="lyric">over</em>.</h1>
      <p class="bp-lede">
        What came after the Authentic Singing Journey — losing the thread, finding it again, and the
        way Upala moved.
      </p>
      <p class="bp-byline">
        <time datetime={post.date}>{post.dateLabel}</time>
        <span class="bp-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {post.readingMinutes} min read
      </p>
    </header>

    <figure class="bp-hero">
      <img src={post.hero} alt={post.heroAlt} fetchpriority="high" />
    </figure>

    <div class="bp-body">
      <p>
        In the first part of this story, I told you how the Authentic Singing Journey began — with no
        money, a borrowed year, and Upala beside me. If you haven't read it yet, that's
        <a href="/blog/before-there-was-upala">where the Songdance story starts</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        When Upala and I finished that first journey, we honestly had no idea what would come next.
      </p>
      <p>
        And for a while, we lost the thread of it. We slipped into managing the <em>business</em> of
        Songdance far more than we were creating or inspiring anything — and the irony wasn't lost on
        us: the harder we pushed to promote the course, the harder it all seemed to become.
      </p>
      <p>
        So we made a decision. We had to get back to what Songdance really is — to making things that
        inspire expression and healing, and not much else.
      </p>

      <figure class="bp-figure">
        <img
          src="/media/library/upala-on-rock.webp"
          alt="Upala standing on a rock in a mountain river, sounding, her hands open"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Upala — a free spirit, in her sounding and in the way she moved.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <p>
        In the time that followed, two new programs came. The <strong>Inner Child Healing Journey</strong>
        — the smallest of our three journeys, and quietly one of the most loved. And the
        <strong>Magical Movement Journey</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>And at the very heart of the movement journey is the way Upala moved.</p>

      <blockquote class="bp-pull">
        <p>
          Just as she did with her sounding, she moved as a free spirit — never to a script, only ever
          following what her body was asking for in the moment.
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        So I built the journey around that. Ten pieces of music, and just enough gentle company to keep
        you moving — but no choreography, nothing to get right. The music carries it; your body does the
        rest, however it likes.
      </p>
      <p>
        We had so much fun making it, and living it — dancing and moving to it on our own, or with
        friends out in South Africa. There are a few old videos of those days tucked onto
        <a href="/courses/magical-movement">the journey's page</a>; I think you'll love watching Upala
        move to the music.
      </p>
      <p>
        My hope for it is a simple one — that it does for you what it did for us. Your own creativity
        waking and flowing again, just from coming back into your body and letting these ten pieces of
        music move you.
      </p>
      <p>
        That's how the movement journey came to be. There's more of the Songdance story still to tell —
        but that, again, is for another day.
      </p>

      <p class="bp-signoff">With love,<br />Jacob</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="bp-cta">
      <p class="sd-eyebrow">The journey at its heart</p>
      <h2 class="bp-cta-head">Ten pieces of music, and your own <em class="lyric">movement.</em></h2>
      <p class="bp-cta-body">
        Do-at-home, standing or seated, begin anytime — the movement journey Upala and I made, with the
        old videos of her moving that started it all.
      </p>
      <a href="/courses/magical-movement" class="bp-cta-btn">
        Discover the Magical Movement Journey
        <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </aside>

    <nav class="bp-back">
      <a href="/blog"><i class="ph-light ph-arrow-left"></i> All journal entries</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .bp {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .bp-head {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--sp-9) var(--sp-6) var(--sp-6);
  }
  .bp-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.2vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: var(--tr-display);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: var(--sp-4) 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  /* Typography law: Cormorant italic reads small inside Spectral display — bump it. */
  .bp-title em.lyric {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.05em;
    color: var(--ember);
  }
  .bp-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2.6vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 36ch;
    margin: var(--sp-5) 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .bp-byline {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--t-caption);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-quiet);
    margin: var(--sp-5) 0 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-3);
  }
  .bp-byline .bp-dot {
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink-whisper);
  }

  /* ---------- Hero image ---------- */
  .bp-hero {
    max-width: var(--container);
    margin: var(--sp-6) auto 0;
    padding: 0 var(--sp-6);
  }
  .bp-hero img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    filter: var(--sd-img-filter);
  }

  /* ---------- Body ---------- */
  .bp-body {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--sp-7) var(--sp-6) 0;
  }
  .bp-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--t-body-lg);
    line-height: var(--lh-prose);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-5);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  /* Plain emphasis stays in the body italic (no lyric swap → no bump needed). */
  .bp-body em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  /* A deliberate lyric flourish — swaps to Cormorant, so it must be sized up. */
  .bp-body em.lyric {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.25em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--ember-deep);
  }
  /* In-prose links — an ember underline that reads as part of the sentence. */
  .bp-body a {
    color: var(--ember-deep);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    transition: color var(--d-base) var(--ease);
  }
  .bp-body a:hover {
    color: var(--plum);
  }

  .bp-figure {
    margin: var(--sp-7) 0;
  }
  .bp-figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    filter: var(--sd-img-filter);
  }
  .bp-figure figcaption {
    margin: var(--sp-3) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink-quiet);
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .bp-pull {
    margin: var(--sp-7) 0;
    padding: var(--sp-1) 0 var(--sp-1) var(--sp-5);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--ember);
  }
  .bp-pull p {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .bp-body p.bp-signoff {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top: var(--sp-7);
  }

  /* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- */
  .bp-cta {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: var(--sp-8) auto 0;
    padding: var(--sp-7) var(--sp-6);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: var(--paper-deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
  }
  .bp-cta-head {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: var(--t-h2);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: var(--sp-3) 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .bp-cta-head em.lyric {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.05em;
    color: var(--ember-deep);
  }
  .bp-cta-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--t-body);
    line-height: var(--lh-prose);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: var(--sp-4) 0 0;
    max-width: 48ch;
  }
  .bp-cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
    background: var(--ember-deep);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    transition: background var(--d-base) var(--ease);
  }
  .bp-cta-btn:hover {
    background: var(--plum);
  }
  .bp-cta-btn i {
    font-size: 17px;
    transition: transform var(--d-base) var(--ease);
  }
  .bp-cta-btn:hover i {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  /* ---------- Back link ---------- */
  .bp-back {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: var(--sp-7) auto var(--sp-9);
    padding: 0 var(--sp-6);
  }
  .bp-back a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .bp-back a:hover {
    color: var(--ember-deep);
  }
  .bp-back i {
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: transform var(--d-base) var(--ease);
  }
  .bp-back a:hover i {
    transform: translateX(-4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .bp-head {
      padding: var(--sp-8) var(--sp-5) var(--sp-5);
    }
    .bp-hero {
      padding: 0 var(--sp-5);
    }
    .bp-body {
      padding: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-5) 0;
    }
    .bp-cta {
      padding: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-5);
      margin-left: var(--sp-5);
      margin-right: var(--sp-5);
    }
    .bp-back {
      padding: 0 var(--sp-5);
    }
  }
</style>
